        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "krJ8x",
          "name": "Notes",
          "width": 340,
          "fill": "#fff8dc",
          "cornerRadius": 6,
          "stroke": "#e8d9a0",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 14,
          "padding": 20,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZZ902",
              "name": "Notes title",
              "fill": "#281d1b",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Tapestry: what's new",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lky0Y",
              "name": "Note 1",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. VIDEO button in the header opens or closes the video window. Highlighted while the window is open. Hidden when Video is turned off in Preferences.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "V4vUOX",
              "name": "Note 2",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. A film icon marks scenes that have videos, in the scene list and in the Tapestry.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EDegP",
              "name": "Note 3",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. Same rule as music: the top-most enabled scene with videos plays them. A scene above without videos leaves them playing, unless its \"Hide the video below\" switch is on (then the screen goes black).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "P0Cln",
              "name": "Note 4",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. Effects and Video effects share the right column. Video effects take only the height they need (here two buttons) and the sound effects scroll in the rest, so video effects never hide at the bottom of a long list. If both lists are long, each gets half and scrolls on its own. Clicking a video effect replaces the playing video until it ends (progress line below), then the playlist comes back where it was. Click again to stop it early.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BVfmC",
              "name": "Note 5",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. Bottom bar: what the video window is showing, with the scene, the position and when it switches to the next video. Click it to open the video window. Space pauses the video along with the sound; Esc stops both.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "iBrG8",
              "name": "Note 6",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. The Library drawer counts videos too.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
