            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tCuiQ",
              "name": "Note 1",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. The same dialog as today, with a new Audio / Video choice once a page has been looked at. Direct links pick it from the file type (.mp3 or .webm).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "W3hVI2",
              "name": "Note 2",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. Video downloads the picture only (no audio track).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "thb6z",
              "name": "Note 3",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. Resolution: Up to 720p / 1080p (default, set in Preferences) / 1440p / Best available. Size is estimated from the chosen format.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c4YaT7",
              "name": "Note 4",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. Format: WebM (VP9 or AV1) is preferred, since it plays on Linux without extra codecs. If the site only offers MP4, the yellow note replaces the green badge and the file is converted after downloading (it shows \"converting…\" in the queue).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lw6z6",
              "name": "Note 5",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. Only part of it, Save to (Library › Video folders), the queue, progress, cancel and resuming after a restart all work as for audio.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
