        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "XYh5w",
          "name": "Notes",
          "width": 340,
          "fill": "#fff8dc",
          "cornerRadius": 6,
          "stroke": "#e8d9a0",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 14,
          "padding": 20,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lta7H",
              "name": "Notes title",
              "fill": "#281d1b",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Library: videos",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zdNAu",
              "name": "Note 1",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. A fourth category, Video, with its own folders (real subfolders of the project's video/ folder, like audio). Folders, moving, renaming, tags, favourites and search work as for sounds.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "zAPIK",
              "name": "Note 2",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. One category for both: a video can be in a scene's playlist and be a video effect. (Sounds are split into Music/Ambience/Effects because they behave differently; videos all behave the same.)",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "W7tsgR",
              "name": "Note 3",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. Smart list \"May not play\" lists videos that weren't converted; each has a Convert button on its page. Missing files and Unused include videos too.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u5BQKT",
              "name": "Note 4",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. The video's page: a preview player (muted, in the page), folder, tags, format line (green \"plays here\" or yellow \"may not play\" with CONVERT), where it's used, the file and its source if downloaded (with Download again).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ww52g",
              "name": "Note 5",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. No cropping for videos in this first version (could come later, the same way as sounds).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ni19f",
              "name": "Note 6",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. The header shows background conversions, like downloads and fingerprinting.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "R5s01o",
              "name": "Note 7",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7. The Library drawer on the Tapestry view gets a fourth column, Video, so videos can be dragged onto scenes.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
