              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Preferences: Video",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sO72T",
              "name": "Note 1",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. A new Video page. \"Use videos\" is the on/off switch for the whole feature, per computer (a laptop without a TV can leave it off).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s47bTK",
              "name": "Note 2",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. Screen lists the connected screens; if the chosen one isn't connected, the window opens on the main screen.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kcDFG",
              "name": "Note 3",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. Picture: fill the window (cropping the edges) or show the whole picture (black bars).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g4sXB",
              "name": "Note 4",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. Videos that may not play: Ask (the dialog on screen 5) / Always convert / Never convert.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "h95iA",
              "name": "Note 5",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. Defaults for new projects are copied into each project, like the sound defaults. Project settings gets a matching Video section for the open project, and Backups gets \"Include videos\" (off by default: videos are big).",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Wj5XJ",
              "name": "Note 6",
              "fill": "#3a2e28",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. Export gets an \"Include videos\" choice next to \"Include audio\".",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
